# JS layout

Follow `bootstrap.md` §8. Do not invent a parallel tree.

```
js/main.js                 # rAF loop, pause when pad missing
js/input/gamepad.js        # poll, two-stick check, disconnect
js/physics/board.js        # later
js/physics/skater.js       # later
js/physics/world.js        # later
js/tricks/detector.js      # later
js/audio/engine.js         # later
js/scene/setup.js          # Three.js scene, lights, camera
js/scene/skaterModel.js    # later
js/scene/boardModel.js     # later
js/scene/environment.js    # later
js/ui/overlay.js           # controller gate, pause, HUD
js/constants.js            # every tunable, commented
```

- Fixed timestep (~1/120 s) + interpolation for render. rAF for the frame.
- Tunables only in `constants.js`. Stick deadzone/invert belong there; settings UI comes later.
- Phase 4: kick/heelflip scoop, catch, shuv. No grind lock, no Web Audio yet.
